# Packaging output
/out/

# NOT external/bin — the 7-Zip builds under it are committed on purpose.
# core/archive.py has no pure-Python fallback, so a package built without them
# installs nothing, and 7-zip.org serves several releases at once (pinned URLs
# rot) while the Windows build itself ships as a .7z. scripts/fetch_tools.py is
# the hand-run updater; --check verifies what is committed, and CI fails on it.

